We are familiar with anti-money-laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and ensure that our platform does not undermine a firm's reporting obligations. We also respect auditor independence and separation of duties, ensuring that our platform is used as a non-decisional support tool.

Finally, we guarantee data sovereignty by hosting all data within the EU and ensuring that no data is transferred outside the EU. Our infrastructure is designed to ensure the protection of sensitive data, using encryption and pseudonymisation where relevant.

By implementing these security measures, we can guarantee compliance with the mentioned regulatory requirements and provide a secure and reliable platform for our clients.
